nodes.body:
@vadiklyutiy 

I should revalidate as MRV2 changes some things around, but on vLLM 0.24.0, I did have explicit benchmarks where FI was more performant! I forgot if I benchmarked again when upgrading from 0.24.0 to 0.29.0.

There are some other defaults that might not be best: I did find explicitly turning on async scheduling to help in high throughput scenarios as opposed to the default 'async-scheduling off for pooling' config. Might also need to rerun that for MRV2.

